## March 21, 2025","type_i_return_treatment":"It is assumed that no cash return or financing cost occurs in the volatility control process. The Index Value is Excess Return:","type_ii_return_treatment":"It is assumed that cash returns are earned by 100% of the Index Value despite the change in the exposure of the Underlying Index. The Index Value is Total Return:","type_iii_return_treatment":"It is assumed that financing costs occur on the exposure of the Underlying Index. The Index Value is Excess Return:","type_iv_return_treatment":"c) If the exposure of the Underlying Index is equal to 100%, there will be no cash return or financing cost.

